# Runtime test scratch. The sharness-style harness (test-lib.sh) runs each test
# inside trash.$$ and removes it on exit, but stray/older runs can leave repo
# working directories here. None of these belong in version control — one of
# them (extreme-path-test) created a 600+ character path that exceeds Windows
# MAX_PATH and broke `git checkout` on Windows runners, so no win32 binary was
# ever published.
/trash.*/
/test-results/
/*-test/
/test-repo/
